    {"unit": "W01-04", "code": "P", "page": "p. 631; p. 632", "position": null, "drift": false, "reasoning_stated": true, "note": "The paper prints one veteran analyst expecting the move (p. 631) and capacity given as a reason (p. 632). It gives no count of how many in the unit would switch if capacity allowed, and says the loss of autonomy and variety troubled the analysts most (p. 632). 'Most of the unit' is a judgment."},
