    {"unit": "W01-06", "code": "RA", "page": null, "position": null, "drift": false, "reasoning_stated": null, "note": "GC/MS use for unknowns is printed (p. 629). The paper records no objection to that use. Objections concern a wholesale move to instrumentation (pp. 631–632)."},
