    {"unit": "W02-18", "code": "RA", "page": null, "position": null, "drift": false, "reasoning_stated": null, "note": "No before-and-after of the bench work is printed for the uncertainty change, and the analyst says the method is unchanged (p. 628). The only earlier change noted is a protocol update more than five years prior (p. 627)."},
