    {"unit": "W06-02", "code": "P", "page": "p. 613; pp. 619–620; p. 630", "position": null, "drift": false, "reasoning_stated": true, "note": "Reassignment, retraining and leaving toxicology are printed. The paper says analysts are hired into a specific unit after tests and interview (p. 613), and prints only one analyst who took a post because it was open (p. 630). Placement by opening as the general rule is a judgment."},
