    {"unit": "W06-10", "code": "P", "page": "p. 630", "position": null, "drift": false, "reasoning_stated": false, "note": "The paper attributes the contrast with toxicology to the narcotics analysts generally. Only one quoted speaker is identified as having left toxicology. Attributing the contrast to those who left is a judgment."},
