    {"unit": "W07-18", "code": "RA", "page": null, "position": null, "drift": false, "reasoning_stated": null, "note": "Speed is absent from the narcotics values in Table 2 and the discussion (pp. 633–637). The infrequent-use wording is on p. 633."},
